WEBVTT

01:33.390 --> 01:35.360
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.431 --> 01:37.860
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.954 --> 01:40.824
(Episode 28)

01:47.840 --> 01:48.571
Hello.

01:49.571 --> 01:50.510
Let me send you home.

01:50.741 --> 01:52.411
I'll come back after you're home.

01:53.081 --> 01:54.010
It's okay.

01:54.081 --> 01:55.581
It's convenient for me to drive back.

01:55.950 --> 01:57.010
Besides, if my mom sees...

01:57.081 --> 01:58.151
that I didn't bring my car back,

01:58.220 --> 01:59.620
she'll surely ask questions.

01:59.980 --> 02:00.851
It's troublesome.

02:03.521 --> 02:04.450
Don't miss me too much.

02:05.991 --> 02:07.220
As if I will.

02:08.260 --> 02:09.090
But I...

02:09.461 --> 02:10.461
will miss you.

02:11.401 --> 02:12.931
Okay, I'm hanging up.

02:14.101 --> 02:15.500
She has been glowing lately.

02:20.301 --> 02:22.940
I'll miss you then.

02:24.810 --> 02:26.481
I have goosebumps all over from that.

02:30.011 --> 02:30.750
Zhai Miao.

02:31.211 --> 02:32.120
Come here.

02:35.190 --> 02:35.850
What is it?

02:38.590 --> 02:40.790
- Itching for a beating again? - No, Song Yan.

02:40.861 --> 02:43.991
People who are in love become much more nice.

02:44.060 --> 02:45.630
Why did you become so grumpy?

02:45.701 --> 02:47.130
Let go!

02:47.600 --> 02:48.271
Let go.

02:50.431 --> 02:51.771
You messed up my hair.

02:53.870 --> 02:55.440
You always come home.

02:55.771 --> 02:56.771
Have you written your thesis?

02:58.880 --> 03:00.141
Well,

03:00.211 --> 03:02.211
I came to see you...

03:02.280 --> 03:03.810
since you're finally resting at home.

03:04.551 --> 03:06.581
We're siblings after all.

03:09.991 --> 03:11.491
Get to the point. Make it quick.

03:14.391 --> 03:16.231
Actually, I just want to borrow...

03:16.290 --> 03:18.301
your point of view as a straight man.

03:18.701 --> 03:20.030
Between these two photos,

03:20.100 --> 03:21.570
which one is better?

03:21.630 --> 03:22.431
Look.

03:22.600 --> 03:23.331
This one?

03:24.301 --> 03:25.141
Or this one?

03:25.870 --> 03:27.141
Aren't they the same?

03:27.771 --> 03:29.040
How are they the same?

03:29.111 --> 03:30.040
Take a closer look.

03:30.141 --> 03:31.440
There's a subtle difference...

03:31.511 --> 03:33.111
between the two photos.

03:33.181 --> 03:34.141
See for yourself.

03:34.681 --> 03:35.511
There's no difference.

03:35.581 --> 03:36.651
They're the same.

03:36.711 --> 03:37.750
Aren't they all the same person?

03:39.651 --> 03:41.120
You're really lame.

03:41.521 --> 03:42.651
If Xu Qin asks you the same thing...

03:42.720 --> 03:43.590
and you said that,

03:43.651 --> 03:44.921
she'd be so mad at you.

03:46.820 --> 03:48.090
She didn't ask me.

03:48.431 --> 03:49.491
She didn't?

03:49.761 --> 03:50.761
How is that possible?

03:50.861 --> 03:53.660
Which girlfriend doesn't send photos to her boyfriend?

03:55.231 --> 03:56.630
Does this mean...

03:56.701 --> 03:58.771
that she takes you for an outsider?

04:00.241 --> 04:00.940
Get out.

04:02.241 --> 04:03.540
Why are you so anxious?

04:03.711 --> 04:05.681
You're doing this every day instead of studying.

04:05.741 --> 04:06.741
Do your parents know?

04:08.410 --> 04:09.910
I was thinking...

04:09.981 --> 04:11.880
I'd tell them after I make big money.

04:12.021 --> 04:13.250
Big money?

04:14.181 --> 04:15.651
It's not as easy as you think.

04:16.421 --> 04:17.220
Let me ask you.

04:18.461 --> 04:19.491
Even if you really get popular,

04:19.690 --> 04:20.560
she can go solo.

04:21.630 --> 04:22.491
What do you have?

04:23.160 --> 04:25.160
We're classmates. We won't split up.

04:25.401 --> 04:26.331
Besides,

04:26.701 --> 04:27.730
I have the account.

04:27.930 --> 04:29.001
The account is yours.

04:29.401 --> 04:30.730
The face is hers.

04:31.540 --> 04:33.170
Then I'll split half the money with her.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.441
But you're right.

04:37.840 --> 04:39.081
I should find time...

04:39.141 --> 04:40.641
to sign the contract with her.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.480
Song Yan.

04:44.850 --> 04:45.780
You know what?

04:45.850 --> 04:47.550
Right now, I can earn...

04:47.621 --> 04:49.251
10,000 yuan a month.

04:56.430 --> 04:57.331
Aunt!

04:57.490 --> 04:58.660
- Yes? - Song Yan!

04:58.930 --> 04:59.660
Come here.

04:59.860 --> 05:00.761
Sit.

05:00.831 --> 05:02.470
I'll buy a bag for your girlfriend.

05:04.600 --> 05:05.771
You'll buy a bag for her?

05:06.170 --> 05:07.540
That's more like it.

05:09.371 --> 05:10.311
You've matured.

05:12.081 --> 05:14.011
What is it, Yan Er?

05:17.550 --> 05:19.321
Please, Song Yan.

05:20.220 --> 05:21.220
It's nothing, Aunt.

05:24.850 --> 05:25.920
You're the best.

05:29.961 --> 05:30.831
How is this?

05:32.100 --> 05:33.100
Harder.

05:33.461 --> 05:34.201
Okay.

05:37.670 --> 05:39.001
All right.

05:39.340 --> 05:40.800
Here.

06:00.790 --> 06:02.930
The door is open. Enter.

06:04.930 --> 06:06.530
Your brother came back last week,

06:06.930 --> 06:07.800
but you didn't.

06:08.501 --> 06:09.771
You're back this week,

06:09.831 --> 06:11.071
but your brother doesn't.

06:11.131 --> 06:12.141
Did you two...

06:12.340 --> 06:13.641
agree on this?

06:14.441 --> 06:15.711
Maybe it's just a coincidence.

06:15.771 --> 06:17.441
It's the end of the year. Everyone's busy.

06:17.941 --> 06:18.840
Have more soup.

06:19.426 --> 06:20.455
I haven't seen you for over a month.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.881
I feel like you've lost weight again.

06:21.951 --> 06:22.711
Here.

06:22.980 --> 06:23.850
Thank you, Dad.

06:23.980 --> 06:25.220
You haven't seen your brother...

06:25.521 --> 06:26.920
for a long time too, right?

06:28.720 --> 06:30.521
I just feel like he has something on his mind.

06:31.251 --> 06:32.660
How about you ask him?

06:32.860 --> 06:34.720
If I do, he won't say anything.

06:39.461 --> 06:40.660
When both of you are not home,

06:40.860 --> 06:42.501
this house is too lonely.

06:43.271 --> 06:44.930
They should get married soon.

06:45.040 --> 06:46.001
When they have a child,

06:46.371 --> 06:47.641
this house will be lively.

06:48.240 --> 06:49.240
That's true.

06:52.581 --> 06:53.410
Dad, Mom.

06:54.881 --> 06:56.151
I have a boyfriend.

07:05.191 --> 07:06.021
How long has it been?

07:06.621 --> 07:07.561
Not long.

07:08.061 --> 07:09.290
It has been less than a month.

07:11.191 --> 07:12.401
Break up with him then.

07:17.831 --> 07:19.540
I've known him for over ten years.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.040
He is...

07:21.571 --> 07:23.110
the boyfriend...

07:23.670 --> 07:24.740
I went to college with,

07:25.511 --> 07:26.410
Song Yan.

07:28.980 --> 07:30.151
How was my guess?

07:30.211 --> 07:31.680
She hasn't been coming home lately...

07:31.751 --> 07:32.920
and I knew.

07:35.191 --> 07:35.951
Qin Qin.

07:38.321 --> 07:39.561
Your dad and I don't agree with it.

07:40.420 --> 07:41.090
Qin Qin.

07:42.160 --> 07:43.331
Song Yan was a hooligan...

07:43.691 --> 07:45.061
in school.

07:45.860 --> 07:46.961
A few years ago,

07:47.030 --> 07:48.100
his parents had some problems.

07:48.501 --> 07:50.331
Why do you insist on being with him?

07:50.401 --> 07:51.901
What do his parents' matter...

07:52.100 --> 07:53.771
have to do with him?

07:53.840 --> 07:55.240
He's a victim too.

07:55.311 --> 07:56.771
He was just rebellious before.

07:56.840 --> 07:58.011
He's not a bad person.

07:58.170 --> 08:00.110
Once a girl is in love,

08:00.180 --> 08:01.211
she becomes completely blind.

08:01.340 --> 08:03.050
Your mom and I are worried...

08:03.110 --> 08:04.480
that you'll fall for his tricks.

08:04.610 --> 08:06.021
He's not tricking me.

08:06.550 --> 08:08.151
There's nothing for him to lie to me about.

08:08.220 --> 08:09.790
Even if he isn't lying to you,

08:10.720 --> 08:12.860
does he have everything...

08:13.490 --> 08:14.360
that you already have now?

08:15.391 --> 08:17.391
Your educational background, family background,

08:17.461 --> 08:19.561
and living conditions don't match.

08:19.631 --> 08:21.300
Your gap is so far apart.

08:21.501 --> 08:23.001
The difference in values...

08:24.001 --> 08:26.401
will show themselves sooner or later.

08:26.641 --> 08:27.901
When that happens,

08:28.271 --> 08:30.771
big and small problems will keep coming up.

08:32.711 --> 08:33.910
Between him and me,

08:34.180 --> 08:36.050
there are no big or small problems,

08:37.381 --> 08:38.850
besides your objection.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.121
Qin Qin, just because there aren't any now...

08:43.190 --> 08:45.261
it doesn't mean they won't exist in the future.

08:45.690 --> 08:47.261
Let me give you a simple example.

08:47.361 --> 08:48.320
Let's say...

08:48.690 --> 08:50.330
Let's say you like French cuisine.

08:50.491 --> 08:51.361
But he...

08:51.861 --> 08:53.861
can only take you to street stalls.

08:54.231 --> 08:55.471
Of course you can eat street food.

08:55.530 --> 08:57.871
You can eat at street stalls with him every day.

08:58.271 --> 09:00.570
But can he eat French food with you every day?

09:00.971 --> 09:01.841
No.

09:02.241 --> 09:03.570
Because two French meals...

09:03.641 --> 09:05.881
might cost him a month's salary.

09:06.210 --> 09:07.080
Qin Qin.

09:07.341 --> 09:08.210
Both of you...

09:08.280 --> 09:10.550
live in two completely different environments.

09:10.611 --> 09:13.481
The degree of difficulty and understanding of life...

09:13.550 --> 09:15.891
is also completely different.

09:18.491 --> 09:19.491
Dad, Mom.

09:19.861 --> 09:21.290
I understand...

09:21.460 --> 09:22.631
what you're saying.

09:22.690 --> 09:24.861
I've been thinking about it these days.

09:25.861 --> 09:27.261
I've thought it through.

09:27.731 --> 09:29.271
I don't want to have French food.

09:30.631 --> 09:32.341
I don't want street food either.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.771
I just want to eat...

09:36.241 --> 09:37.310
the food he cooked.

09:37.871 --> 09:39.011
For the past ten years,

09:39.080 --> 09:40.780
I've been eating at restaurants every day.

09:40.940 --> 09:41.950
I'm sick of it.

09:42.410 --> 09:43.580
Now,

09:43.780 --> 09:45.050
I want to marry him.

09:45.550 --> 09:47.121
I want to have my own family.

09:48.221 --> 09:49.521
I want to eat the food he cooks for me.

09:49.591 --> 09:50.391
Okay?

09:50.450 --> 09:53.361
What did this man put in your head?

09:53.420 --> 09:56.231
You won't listen to us anymore.

09:56.391 --> 09:58.960
If you're not happy in your marriage...

09:59.030 --> 10:00.401
and your future life don't turn out well,

10:00.601 --> 10:01.530
we'll feel guilty.

10:01.601 --> 10:04.871
We'll feel sorry for your birth parents.

10:04.930 --> 10:06.271
It wasn't easy for us to raise you.

10:06.341 --> 10:07.601
We doted on you and loved you.

10:07.670 --> 10:08.641
We didn't do it...

10:08.710 --> 10:10.271
to send you to someone else's house...

10:10.341 --> 10:11.410
to do the dishes,

10:11.471 --> 10:12.481
do the laundry,

10:12.680 --> 10:13.741
or mop the floor.

10:13.881 --> 10:14.741
Dad, Mom.

10:15.680 --> 10:17.310
I know you're worried about me.

10:17.381 --> 10:18.351
That you love me.

10:18.410 --> 10:19.920
That you don't trust him.

10:21.351 --> 10:23.190
But I know what kind of person he is.

10:23.251 --> 10:24.651
Then trust me, okay?

10:24.721 --> 10:25.420
Qin Qin.

10:25.660 --> 10:27.290
Frankly speaking,

10:27.361 --> 10:29.290
in your relationship with Song Yan,

10:29.361 --> 10:31.631
he's the one reaping the benefits.

10:31.690 --> 10:32.660
How many fewer years...

10:32.731 --> 10:34.060
does he have to struggle if he's with you?

10:34.131 --> 10:35.670
Have you thought about that?

10:35.731 --> 10:37.330
In our relationship,

10:37.631 --> 10:39.700
I'm the one who benefits from it.

10:42.040 --> 10:44.170
I really like him.

10:44.241 --> 10:45.440
I really, really do.

10:45.511 --> 10:47.881
I'm happy when I'm with him.

10:48.481 --> 10:51.210
I just want to make myself happier, can't I?

10:52.780 --> 10:53.550
Yes.

10:53.820 --> 10:54.780
Mom said...

10:55.180 --> 10:56.920
people can't have everything.

10:57.790 --> 10:59.320
Let's say, to be with him,

10:59.460 --> 11:01.320
I'll have to lose something.

11:01.460 --> 11:02.891
To be with him,

11:03.030 --> 11:05.060
I'll have to face the problems you mentioned.

11:05.930 --> 11:07.601
I still want to choose him.

11:07.660 --> 11:09.300
I just want him.

11:09.930 --> 11:11.170
I've always listened to you.

11:11.231 --> 11:12.371
Can I not do it this once?

11:12.440 --> 11:13.200
Just this once.

11:13.271 --> 11:14.170
Qin Qin.

11:14.871 --> 11:16.210
Even if you lose your parents...

11:16.271 --> 11:17.310
or your brother,

11:18.170 --> 11:19.810
will you still choose him?

11:19.940 --> 11:20.780
Is that it?

11:21.080 --> 11:22.910
Why must you do this?

11:22.981 --> 11:25.721
It's not that I want you to marry a certain someone.

11:26.221 --> 11:27.450
But you should at least find someone...

11:27.521 --> 11:28.891
from a similar background.

11:28.950 --> 11:30.121
This won't do.

11:30.751 --> 11:31.790
There's no negotiation.

11:33.391 --> 11:34.491
Give it a try if you dare.

12:10.560 --> 12:11.290
I'm sorry.

12:14.131 --> 12:15.101
I'm sorry.

12:16.501 --> 12:17.871
For this man,

12:19.040 --> 12:20.440
you're going to cut ties...

12:20.501 --> 12:22.170
with this family and your parents.

12:22.670 --> 12:23.440
Is that right?

12:24.170 --> 12:25.810
Even if I get kicked out,

12:28.710 --> 12:30.550
you'll always be my parents.

12:31.950 --> 12:33.050
I won't forget...

12:33.820 --> 12:35.050
your grace in raising me.

12:35.521 --> 12:37.251
I'll visit you every week.

12:38.521 --> 12:39.261
Even if...

12:40.761 --> 12:42.231
you won't let me inside,

12:42.830 --> 12:43.830
I'll still come.

12:48.131 --> 12:49.670
If you're unhappy,

12:50.930 --> 12:52.001
just scold me.

12:54.070 --> 12:55.710
If you don't even want to scold me,

12:57.741 --> 12:58.881
or talk to me,

13:02.881 --> 13:04.011
I'll still come.

13:07.151 --> 13:08.381
I'll do my best...

13:08.450 --> 13:09.621
to be filial to you.

13:12.960 --> 13:13.820
Do you think...

13:14.361 --> 13:15.631
I'll become soft-hearted...

13:16.190 --> 13:17.430
just because you're wheedling me?

13:21.930 --> 13:22.601
Dad.

13:23.670 --> 13:24.871
I'm sorry.

13:26.841 --> 13:28.001
I have no other choice...

13:30.310 --> 13:32.040
but to do this.

13:36.710 --> 13:37.580
Qin Qin.

13:40.580 --> 13:42.050
You're too immature.

13:44.151 --> 13:45.861
You broke my heart.

14:43.550 --> 14:44.810
From the looks of it,

14:45.151 --> 14:47.180
Qin Qin is determined this time.

14:47.651 --> 14:49.050
Don't worry.

14:50.391 --> 14:51.790
She can't outwit me.

14:52.621 --> 14:53.920
I raised her.

14:54.060 --> 14:55.290
I know.

14:56.460 --> 14:57.930
She's just like Yan Chen.

14:58.160 --> 14:58.930
Soft-hearted...

14:59.430 --> 15:00.401
and filial.

15:01.231 --> 15:02.930
She won't cut ties with us.

15:05.030 --> 15:06.771
She just likes the novelty for now.

15:08.570 --> 15:09.871
After some time,

15:09.940 --> 15:11.111
when she sees...

15:11.271 --> 15:13.040
what that family is like,

15:13.111 --> 15:14.381
then she'll back off.

15:14.511 --> 15:16.351
Their lifestyles are night and day.

15:16.410 --> 15:17.751
She won't be used to it.

15:17.950 --> 15:19.481
She'll come back very soon.

15:22.151 --> 15:24.190
Of all people,

15:24.251 --> 15:26.621
why does it have to be Song Zhi Yong's son?

15:28.261 --> 15:29.131
Huai Jin.

15:29.690 --> 15:30.560
This time,

15:30.631 --> 15:32.901
you have to stand with me.

15:33.660 --> 15:35.261
You can't play the good cop anymore.

15:52.251 --> 15:54.050
What's wrong with Miao Miao?

15:54.320 --> 15:55.521
She was hiding in her room...

15:55.591 --> 15:56.491
as soon as she came back.

15:56.651 --> 15:57.820
What is she up to?

15:59.621 --> 16:01.361
Maybe she's writing her graduation thesis.

16:06.300 --> 16:07.060
Song Yan.

16:07.460 --> 16:09.501
I have something to tell you.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.700
I just want to talk to you...

16:13.271 --> 16:14.641
about you and Xiao Qin.

16:14.741 --> 16:15.570
Of course.

16:15.670 --> 16:17.111
About you two getting together,

16:17.170 --> 16:19.180
your uncle and I don't have any objections.

16:19.341 --> 16:20.011
Aunt.

16:20.780 --> 16:21.641
If you have any comments,

16:21.810 --> 16:22.751
just say it.

16:25.950 --> 16:27.280
Well,

16:27.950 --> 16:30.091
so many things have happened...

16:30.151 --> 16:31.920
between her family and ours.

16:32.151 --> 16:33.391
Xiao Qin might not know it,

16:33.460 --> 16:34.891
but we do.

16:35.420 --> 16:37.091
One thing after another...

16:37.190 --> 16:38.430
harmed your dad...

16:38.491 --> 16:39.560
and you.

16:39.861 --> 16:41.131
You're in the middle...

16:41.200 --> 16:42.401
of such a serious matter.

16:42.670 --> 16:44.101
There are grudges being held.

16:44.700 --> 16:45.570
I'm just afraid...

16:50.841 --> 16:51.540
Uncle.

16:52.170 --> 16:52.940
Aunt.

16:54.011 --> 16:55.141
I just want to say this.

16:55.210 --> 16:56.450
About the past,

16:56.710 --> 16:57.810
I don't wish to think about it...

16:57.881 --> 16:59.121
nor do I want to.

16:59.780 --> 17:01.450
I just want to cherish the present.

17:02.180 --> 17:03.651
Do you think...

17:03.950 --> 17:05.190
I'm unworthy?

17:08.060 --> 17:09.530
I wanted to let it go.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.301
But for some reason,

17:13.031 --> 17:14.061
we bumped into each other.

17:14.631 --> 17:15.871
Again and again.

17:16.730 --> 17:17.901
It's fine when I don't see them.

17:18.331 --> 17:19.601
But once I do,

17:20.141 --> 17:21.940
it's useless no matter what I say.

17:23.311 --> 17:24.910
I don't care if I'm unworthy.

17:28.510 --> 17:30.151
Who's unworthy?

17:30.950 --> 17:32.750
Our Song Yan is the most worthy.

17:32.821 --> 17:33.520
Right?

17:34.351 --> 17:35.651
Back then...

17:38.321 --> 17:41.121
- Say something. - Be gentle.

17:41.190 --> 17:41.920
Yes.

17:42.020 --> 17:42.960
This...

17:44.061 --> 17:46.131
How are you unworthy?

17:46.631 --> 17:47.460
In this life,

17:47.531 --> 17:49.200
fame and fortune are just for show.

17:49.601 --> 17:51.730
Living with someone you don't like...

17:51.930 --> 17:53.041
is what's meaningless.

18:01.940 --> 18:02.680
Uncle.

18:03.551 --> 18:04.551
I'm sorry...

18:06.051 --> 18:07.321
for what happened back then.

18:07.720 --> 18:09.020
Song Yan.

18:09.821 --> 18:11.720
You've suffered so much.

18:12.321 --> 18:13.891
Why are you sorry?

18:14.690 --> 18:15.690
Your aunt and I...

18:15.760 --> 18:17.561
aren't saying anything else.

18:18.260 --> 18:20.061
Knowing their family back then,

18:21.601 --> 18:23.571
after what happened,

18:23.930 --> 18:26.101
I'm sure they won't approve of you two being together.

18:26.541 --> 18:28.101
I'm afraid that Xiao Qin...

18:28.170 --> 18:30.740
won't be able to persuade her family.

18:31.270 --> 18:33.281
Then you'll be sad again, right?

18:34.581 --> 18:35.611
I know.

18:37.111 --> 18:38.410
But you don't know her.

18:39.581 --> 18:41.051
It's hard for her to make a decision.

18:41.851 --> 18:43.190
But once she has made up her mind,

18:43.651 --> 18:44.891
she won't give up.

18:46.821 --> 18:48.020
Because she knows...

18:49.230 --> 18:50.490
I'll never...

18:51.690 --> 18:52.930
let her down.

18:57.670 --> 18:58.930
What's good today?

19:00.700 --> 19:02.641
We've been waiting for you.

19:07.210 --> 19:07.881
Hello?

19:12.311 --> 19:13.121
Where are you?

19:13.321 --> 19:14.250
I'll be right there.

19:17.591 --> 19:18.490
I'm going out for a while.

19:19.460 --> 19:20.561
What's wrong?

19:25.361 --> 19:26.531
What's going on?

20:44.240 --> 20:45.440
You must be freezing.

20:56.391 --> 20:57.291
Today...

20:57.351 --> 20:58.720
I don't want to talk about it.

21:00.091 --> 21:00.920
Okay.

21:01.591 --> 21:02.531
We won't talk about it.

21:07.061 --> 21:08.131
Song Yan.

21:12.700 --> 21:14.740
I don't want to go back to that house.

21:21.881 --> 21:22.651
Will you go...

21:23.510 --> 21:24.651
to my house?

22:00.151 --> 22:00.920
What's this?

22:01.020 --> 22:01.920
House keys.

22:02.450 --> 22:03.190
Two of them.

22:03.250 --> 22:04.291
One for the front door.

22:04.591 --> 22:05.591
One for my room.

22:15.861 --> 22:16.770
I'm afraid that when I'm at work,

22:16.831 --> 22:17.770
I'd be gone for a week sometimes.

22:17.831 --> 22:18.730
I won't have time for you.

22:19.541 --> 22:20.341
With the keys,

22:21.470 --> 22:22.571
you'll have a place to stay.

22:32.410 --> 22:34.281
I didn't expect the first time I'd bring you here...

22:35.220 --> 22:36.420
would be in such a hurry.

22:38.750 --> 22:40.361
I know you don't like dealing with people.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.321
If you feel uncomfortable inside...

22:42.960 --> 22:43.930
and you feel bad,

22:44.260 --> 22:45.490
you have to tell me.

22:47.801 --> 22:49.500
It's not the first time.

22:53.141 --> 22:53.901
Let's go home and have dinner.

23:00.311 --> 23:01.341
Song Yan, Xu Qin. Hurry.

23:01.410 --> 23:02.440
We're waiting for you to eat.

23:02.710 --> 23:04.551
- Come in. - You must be hungry.

23:05.281 --> 23:06.020
You must be.

23:07.321 --> 23:08.920
Mr. and Mrs. Zhai.

23:09.750 --> 23:10.920
It's cold outside, right?

23:11.190 --> 23:12.151
Right, Zhai Miao.

23:12.220 --> 23:13.490
Get Xiao Qin some warm water.

23:13.561 --> 23:14.561
- That's right. - Okay.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.631
You haven't eaten yet?

23:19.700 --> 23:21.331
No, we were just about to eat...

23:21.430 --> 23:22.801
when my brother got your call.

23:22.871 --> 23:24.571
My dad said to wait to eat with you.

23:24.631 --> 23:25.801
My mom even cooked two more dishes.

23:25.871 --> 23:27.301
Why are you so talkative?

23:27.470 --> 23:28.401
To be honest,

23:28.940 --> 23:29.811
Song Yan suddenly called...

23:29.871 --> 23:31.111
and said you were coming for dinner.

23:31.170 --> 23:32.641
We didn't prepare much.

23:32.811 --> 23:33.781
Next time,

23:33.881 --> 23:35.740
I'll make you more delicious food.

23:35.811 --> 23:37.210
It's already a feast.

23:37.351 --> 23:38.480
They're all my favorite dishes.

23:38.950 --> 23:39.680
Really?

23:39.781 --> 23:40.920
That's great.

23:41.151 --> 23:42.351
Wash your hands and let's eat.

23:42.420 --> 23:43.291
Yes, let's eat.

23:55.531 --> 23:56.401
The left one.

23:57.730 --> 23:58.571
What are you doing?

23:59.670 --> 24:01.901
My aunt didn't want you to wash your hands with cold water.

24:02.170 --> 24:03.710
Hot water on the left, cold water on the right.

24:05.470 --> 24:06.581
I'm not an idiot.

24:08.010 --> 24:08.811
I know.

24:09.980 --> 24:11.051
Make yourself at home.

24:13.180 --> 24:14.551
Mr. and Mrs. Zhai are so friendly.

24:14.621 --> 24:15.781
I'm embarrassed.

24:16.450 --> 24:17.490
It's good that you're used to it.

24:22.020 --> 24:22.791
Let's go.

24:36.071 --> 24:36.811
Mom.

24:37.341 --> 24:39.480
This dish is too bland.

24:39.811 --> 24:40.881
Which one? This one?

24:40.940 --> 24:41.841
Let me try it.

24:46.010 --> 24:47.781
It's not bland. It's good.

24:47.851 --> 24:49.081
Your taste is too strong.

24:49.151 --> 24:50.051
It's just right for me.

24:50.121 --> 24:51.420
Too much salt is not healthy.

24:51.851 --> 24:52.621
Xiao Qin.

24:52.720 --> 24:54.020
If you think something doesn't suit your taste,

24:54.091 --> 24:55.220
you can tell me.

24:55.791 --> 24:57.730
Your cooking is delicious.

24:58.230 --> 24:59.230
Hear that?

25:00.531 --> 25:01.930
Uncle, Aunt.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.470
Xu Qin is moving in.

25:03.531 --> 25:04.871
We're going to get married.

25:07.170 --> 25:09.000
That's great.

25:09.071 --> 25:10.041
Remember, Xiao Qin.

25:10.111 --> 25:12.010
From now on, this is your home.

25:12.071 --> 25:13.281
Yes, don't be shy.

25:13.510 --> 25:14.480
We're family now.

25:16.010 --> 25:17.381
As expected of the honeymoon phase.

25:17.480 --> 25:19.351
Song Yan, for your age,

25:19.410 --> 25:21.821
is it considered an old house catching on fire?

25:22.680 --> 25:23.490
By the way, Song Yan.

25:24.420 --> 25:25.591
This weekend,

25:25.651 --> 25:27.960
take Xiao Qin to buy some furniture.

25:28.020 --> 25:28.791
- Right? - Yes.

25:28.861 --> 25:30.561
It's time for the furniture to be replaced.

25:30.631 --> 25:31.490
It's about time.

25:32.591 --> 25:34.101
Xu Qin, I'll help you move.

25:34.260 --> 25:35.260
It's only right that you help out.

25:40.770 --> 25:41.571
By the way, Xu Qin.

25:42.470 --> 25:44.571
Are you going to stay here tonight?

25:45.440 --> 25:46.881
Why are you asking so many questions?

25:46.940 --> 25:48.180
I didn't ask you.

25:49.010 --> 25:49.750
Xu Qin.

25:49.811 --> 25:51.311
If you don't like my brother's room,

25:51.381 --> 25:52.710
I can go back to school tonight.

25:52.781 --> 25:53.781
You can sleep in my room then.

25:53.851 --> 25:55.051
Right, I have a lot of pajamas.

25:55.121 --> 25:56.720
If you don't mind, you can wear them.

25:56.791 --> 25:57.651
I have tons.

26:04.391 --> 26:05.760
I've said too much.

26:05.831 --> 26:08.061
Children's words carry no harm.

26:08.131 --> 26:10.401
- Let's eat. - Eat up.

26:10.470 --> 26:11.571
Eat more, Xiao Qin.

26:33.960 --> 26:35.291
Aunt is too much.

26:35.591 --> 26:36.891
She laid out two blankets.

26:37.361 --> 26:38.561
That's unnecessary.

26:42.031 --> 26:42.760
What are you doing?

26:43.500 --> 26:44.901
This is good.

26:47.341 --> 26:48.371
Listen to your aunt.

26:49.871 --> 26:51.770
Okay, listen to my aunt.

27:07.990 --> 27:08.891
Here.

27:13.460 --> 27:14.361
Where should I put it?

27:14.430 --> 27:15.660
Here, look.

27:16.500 --> 27:18.101
Here's fine.

27:20.270 --> 27:21.641
Yes, right here. Okay.

27:21.700 --> 27:22.541
Yes. Okay.

27:25.571 --> 27:26.811
Okay. Thank you, everyone.

27:26.940 --> 27:28.680
- You're welcome. - Thank you. Okay.

27:28.781 --> 27:30.010
Such great service.

27:33.321 --> 27:34.680
What are you doing at this hour?

27:34.750 --> 27:36.020
Honey, come here.

27:36.651 --> 27:37.690
I asked my acquaintance...

27:37.750 --> 27:39.091
to pick out some good materials.

27:39.760 --> 27:41.561
Tomorrow, I'll make Qin Qin...

27:41.660 --> 27:42.760
a dresser.

27:43.990 --> 27:46.361
Let them pick one out themselves.

27:46.500 --> 27:48.160
What if she's too shy to say that she doesn't like it,

27:48.230 --> 27:49.131
but can't say no to you?

27:49.200 --> 27:50.031
No, she...

27:53.141 --> 27:54.700
Why wouldn't she like it?

27:54.770 --> 27:57.111
Look, I drew up a modern design.

27:57.270 --> 27:58.641
Look at the drawers and the frame.

27:58.710 --> 28:00.041
It's much more intricate than the ones in the market.

28:00.680 --> 28:03.316
Gosh, it's quite nice.

28:03.381 --> 28:04.151
All right.

28:04.210 --> 28:06.010
If she doesn't like it, give it to me.

28:06.210 --> 28:08.121
If she likes it, I'll make another one just for you.

28:08.220 --> 28:09.051
Okay?

28:09.381 --> 28:11.321
The things in our room are old too.

28:11.391 --> 28:12.520
Shouldn't we get new ones?

28:12.591 --> 28:13.690
Replace them all.

28:13.760 --> 28:14.520
Okay.

28:16.460 --> 28:18.331
Is this room soundproof?

28:27.770 --> 28:28.700
Keep it down.

28:29.071 --> 28:30.210
Zhai Miao can hear us.

28:33.210 --> 28:34.081
What's wrong?

28:35.081 --> 28:36.480
My back is itchy.

28:36.551 --> 28:37.480
Scratch it for me.

28:40.180 --> 28:40.920
Here?

28:41.720 --> 28:42.420
No.

28:42.781 --> 28:43.851
A little lower.

28:44.851 --> 28:45.791
Lower.

28:46.760 --> 28:47.621
A little to the left.

28:48.561 --> 28:49.621
Where is it?

28:53.131 --> 28:54.160
My heart.

29:02.794 --> 29:03.564
Still itchy?

29:04.371 --> 29:05.311
Are you itchy?

29:05.641 --> 29:06.440
Still itchy?

29:07.010 --> 29:08.180
Very itchy.

29:10.480 --> 29:12.410
(I miss a city because there are things to miss in the city)

29:38.670 --> 29:39.440
Let me help you.

29:39.670 --> 29:40.641
I'm almost done.

29:41.480 --> 29:42.740
Roll up my sleeves. Hurry.

30:06.200 --> 30:07.000
Qin Qin.

30:07.071 --> 30:08.341
You've lost weight.

30:08.470 --> 30:10.041
Are you that busy at the hospital...

30:10.111 --> 30:11.111
to eat properly?

30:11.170 --> 30:11.910
From now on,

30:11.970 --> 30:13.740
I'll nourish you well.

30:14.210 --> 30:15.111
You're doomed.

30:15.180 --> 30:16.950
Be careful. You'll turn into a pig.

30:19.381 --> 30:20.821
Did I turn you into a pig?

30:21.851 --> 30:22.581
That's right.

30:22.651 --> 30:23.490
Have an egg.

30:23.950 --> 30:25.591
No more. I just ate one.

30:25.651 --> 30:26.791
Have another one.

30:26.861 --> 30:27.561
I'll eat it.

30:27.621 --> 30:28.361
Okay.

30:28.490 --> 30:29.720
Song Yan needs nourishment too.

30:29.791 --> 30:30.760
You've been working too hard.

30:32.291 --> 30:33.331
Indeed.

30:33.401 --> 30:35.131
Millet porridge, red eggs,

30:35.831 --> 30:36.770
and steamed buns.

30:37.301 --> 30:38.131
I need to nourish myself too.

30:39.031 --> 30:41.101
You do need to nourish yourself.

30:41.170 --> 30:42.401
Save up your energy...

30:42.641 --> 30:44.010
to help Xiao Qin move.

30:44.141 --> 30:46.811
I'm telling you, those heavy and sharp things...

30:46.881 --> 30:48.210
can't be touched by Xiao Qin.

30:48.341 --> 30:50.151
Her hands are a surgeon's hand.

30:50.210 --> 30:51.651
- Got it? - Hear what your mom said?

30:51.980 --> 30:53.781
Don't worry. I won't slack off.

30:53.980 --> 30:55.920
My hands don't need to hold scalpels.

30:56.151 --> 30:57.591
It's fine if they break.

30:58.950 --> 30:59.791
Silly girl.

31:00.260 --> 31:01.920
Dad, look. Mom hit me again.

31:01.990 --> 31:03.230
Well, it makes sense.

31:03.291 --> 31:04.861
Because your hand compared with Qin Qin's,

31:04.930 --> 31:06.230
her hands are indeed valuable.

31:06.391 --> 31:07.601
You have to bear with it.

31:40.131 --> 31:41.061
You don't have to take off your shoes.

31:41.200 --> 31:41.930
Okay.

31:47.700 --> 31:48.500
Xu Qin.

31:48.970 --> 31:50.541
Your house is so big.

31:53.881 --> 31:55.281
Take all those seasonings with you.

31:55.480 --> 31:56.240
Don't waste them.

31:57.111 --> 31:58.651
Leave it to me. Don't worry.

32:05.651 --> 32:07.920
Song Yan, how much is this house worth?

32:08.861 --> 32:09.621
But it's okay.

32:09.690 --> 32:10.891
Your place isn't worse than this.

32:11.160 --> 32:12.631
It's a bit small, but it's cozy.

32:12.690 --> 32:14.260
Once the furniture is in place, it must be better than here.

32:17.831 --> 32:19.371
Why is my mom calling again?

32:20.571 --> 32:21.841
Hello, Mom.

32:25.541 --> 32:26.311
Xu Qin.

32:26.611 --> 32:28.410
My mom wants to know what you want to eat.

32:28.480 --> 32:29.281
Fish.

32:30.881 --> 32:31.551
Fish.

32:33.980 --> 32:34.680
What else?

32:35.851 --> 32:37.321
Beef and broccoli.

32:37.750 --> 32:39.450
Beef and broccoli.

32:44.230 --> 32:45.061
Xu Qin.

32:45.460 --> 32:46.760
You have such a nice house.

32:46.831 --> 32:49.061
Do you feel sad about moving?

32:49.260 --> 32:50.170
Not really.

32:50.470 --> 32:51.670
I'm usually busy with work.

32:52.071 --> 32:53.270
I don't spend much time at home.

32:53.940 --> 32:56.141
It's just a place to live.

32:56.341 --> 32:58.010
I think there should be some memories...

32:58.170 --> 32:59.371
in the place you live.

32:59.440 --> 33:01.281
That's why I'm afraid you'd hesitate.

33:02.781 --> 33:03.811
I don't have...

33:03.950 --> 33:05.210
many memories here.

33:05.811 --> 33:06.920
Every day,

33:06.980 --> 33:09.081
I come home from the hospital.

33:09.151 --> 33:11.291
Then I wash up and go to bed.

33:11.621 --> 33:12.720
It's the same every day.

33:13.821 --> 33:15.190
I don't know my neighbors...

33:15.260 --> 33:16.631
and people rarely visit me.

33:17.361 --> 33:18.631
It's just a house.

33:20.101 --> 33:20.930
Is that so?

33:21.631 --> 33:23.160
If someone asks me...

33:23.230 --> 33:24.901
to move out of that shabby yard,

33:25.031 --> 33:26.841
I might feel a little sad.

33:28.301 --> 33:29.770
A house and a home...

33:29.940 --> 33:30.940
are different.

33:33.410 --> 33:34.240
By the way, Xu Qin.

33:34.410 --> 33:36.480
Aren't you taking these things with you?

33:37.680 --> 33:38.611
These?

33:40.180 --> 33:41.651
My mom gave them to me.

33:42.020 --> 33:42.920
I don't usually have...

33:43.020 --> 33:44.591
the chance to carry them anyway.

33:46.151 --> 33:47.720
This is such a big house.

33:48.821 --> 33:50.331
Is this all you're taking?

33:50.430 --> 33:51.531
Only these things...

33:51.631 --> 33:52.930
belong to me.

33:57.601 --> 33:59.270
Xu Qin, don't be sad.

33:59.331 --> 34:01.270
From now on, our whole family will treat you well.

34:01.341 --> 34:03.200
Look I used to be the one...

34:03.270 --> 34:04.440
who hated you the most.

34:04.510 --> 34:06.170
Now, even I'd take care of you.

34:06.571 --> 34:07.440
So don't worry.

34:08.081 --> 34:09.440
Right, and these.

34:09.510 --> 34:11.051
The bags you didn't take with you.

34:11.111 --> 34:12.250
When I make money,

34:12.311 --> 34:13.081
I'll buy them all for you.

34:13.151 --> 34:14.920
And my brother will buy them for you too.

34:15.450 --> 34:16.451
He doesn't say it,

34:16.520 --> 34:19.091
but deep down,

34:19.250 --> 34:21.120
he really loves you.

34:21.190 --> 34:22.661
He'll do anything for you.

34:23.161 --> 34:24.661
It's true. Trust me.

34:27.600 --> 34:28.761
Let me help you.

34:39.870 --> 34:40.781
What do you think?

34:41.881 --> 34:42.741
It's okay.

34:43.310 --> 34:44.051
What about you?

34:46.080 --> 34:46.920
It's too hard.

34:49.151 --> 34:50.120
Let's try another one.

35:06.370 --> 35:07.971
(Minimalist life)

35:25.390 --> 35:26.151
I like this one.

35:26.420 --> 35:27.161
We'll buy it.

35:28.091 --> 35:28.761
Hello.

35:29.560 --> 35:31.161
- Hello. - Is there one that you like?

35:31.560 --> 35:32.330
We'll take this one.

35:32.991 --> 35:34.161
Sir, you have a good eye.

35:34.301 --> 35:35.931
This bed is very comfortable.

35:36.100 --> 35:37.201
My boss picked it out.

35:39.100 --> 35:40.901
I'd like to know when the delivery will be.

35:40.971 --> 35:41.770
In two weeks.

35:44.770 --> 35:45.741
Can it be quicker?

35:46.241 --> 35:48.411
It's the warehouse that distributes and arranges logistics.

35:48.641 --> 35:49.701
There's nothing we can do.

35:51.781 --> 35:53.250
We'll just wait then.

35:53.420 --> 35:54.281
That won't do.

35:54.580 --> 35:55.620
Will we sleep on the floor every day?

35:59.721 --> 36:00.491
How about this?

36:00.661 --> 36:01.520
Can I take it home myself?

36:02.420 --> 36:03.261
We're in a hurry.

36:03.591 --> 36:04.491
By yourself?

36:17.040 --> 36:18.270
- Chief. - Chief.

36:18.341 --> 36:19.841
- Song Yan. - Song Yan.

36:21.381 --> 36:22.181
What are we moving?

36:23.140 --> 36:23.951
It's a special mission.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.210
Let's go.

36:31.020 --> 36:31.920
Move the bed?

36:32.721 --> 36:34.120
There's a woman on the bed. Do we move her together?

36:35.591 --> 36:36.560
- We're outside. - It's Dr. Xu.

36:38.560 --> 36:39.330
Chief.

36:39.460 --> 36:41.361
Why is Dr. Xu here to buy a bed with you?

36:46.531 --> 36:47.600
When you get back,

36:48.440 --> 36:49.370
get your brain checked.

36:50.741 --> 36:51.810
Are you stupid?

36:51.870 --> 36:52.710
You don't even know that?

36:52.870 --> 36:53.640
Pi Pi.

36:53.781 --> 36:54.741
The flower has bloomed.

36:54.810 --> 36:55.580
- That's right. - What?

36:55.741 --> 36:57.051
Song Yan is no longer single?

36:57.381 --> 36:58.551
What else is the queen bed for?

37:01.850 --> 37:03.651
Thank you for coming here...

37:03.721 --> 37:04.690
on your day off.

37:05.120 --> 37:07.060
- Hello. - Hello.

37:11.261 --> 37:12.161
Is this...

37:12.290 --> 37:13.730
how I trained you?

37:14.801 --> 37:15.761
- Hello. - Hello.

37:15.830 --> 37:17.301
Hello, thanks for this.

37:19.249 --> 37:20.579
All right, guys. Don't just stand there.

37:20.650 --> 37:21.690
Let's move the bed.

37:21.990 --> 37:22.690
Let's go.

37:25.760 --> 37:27.159
Be gentle. Don't break it.

37:31.329 --> 37:32.059
Slowly.

37:33.141 --> 37:34.059
Look up.

37:34.130 --> 37:35.130
Okay, it's fine.

37:36.829 --> 37:37.499
Come on.

37:38.099 --> 37:38.999
Slowly, Pi Pi.

37:39.300 --> 37:40.440
- Slowly. - Be careful.

37:40.999 --> 37:42.099
- Put it here. - Be careful.

37:42.869 --> 37:44.670
Put it here.

37:46.309 --> 37:47.440
Put it here first.

37:47.539 --> 37:49.110
Remove the old one first, then we'll move it in.

37:49.179 --> 37:50.880
- Okay, move the bed upstairs. - Let's go.

37:57.749 --> 37:58.719
Get them some fruit.

38:15.444 --> 38:16.245
Come.

38:17.139 --> 38:17.840
Sit down.

38:18.110 --> 38:18.880
Get some rest.

38:19.710 --> 38:20.840
You're in charge of the inspection.

38:21.309 --> 38:22.150
I'll do the work.

38:22.579 --> 38:23.249
Good girl.

38:36.059 --> 38:36.960
Song Yan.

38:38.337 --> 38:39.866
You spoil me too much.

38:44.670 --> 38:45.599
Are you happy?

38:50.269 --> 38:51.369
When I first joined the team,

38:51.469 --> 38:52.480
I had to do all sorts of work.

38:52.539 --> 38:53.210
I'm used to it.

39:01.579 --> 39:03.019
Do you dare to be included in my household registry?

39:04.519 --> 39:05.519
I, Song Yan, promise,

39:05.889 --> 39:06.619
to love only you...

39:06.789 --> 39:08.320
in my entire life.

39:08.460 --> 39:09.429
You!

39:20.539 --> 39:22.369
So what you said was true.

39:23.498 --> 39:25.239
It was true back then.

39:31.493 --> 39:32.593
You're going back to the team?

39:35.133 --> 39:35.933
I'm leaving.

39:45.142 --> 39:45.903
Xu Qin.

39:47.442 --> 39:48.343
When you're staying here,

39:48.973 --> 39:50.642
you don't have to purposely make my uncle and aunt happy.

39:51.783 --> 39:52.743
You don't like to talk.

39:53.212 --> 39:54.542
They've known it since you were little.

39:54.712 --> 39:55.582
They don't mind.

39:57.613 --> 39:58.823
Just get along with them...

39:59.212 --> 40:00.442
the same as before.

40:02.223 --> 40:03.122
I know.

40:03.852 --> 40:04.622
Hurry up and go.

40:16.232 --> 40:17.372
I'm sorry...

40:18.743 --> 40:19.673
for making you stay here.

40:20.073 --> 40:21.602
What are you talking about?

40:22.442 --> 40:23.843
It doesn't matter where I stay.

40:28.582 --> 40:29.383
All right.

40:30.252 --> 40:31.082
Hurry up and go.

40:36.653 --> 40:37.392
I'm leaving.

40:59.582 --> 41:00.312
Go.

41:08.953 --> 41:09.752
Bye.

41:13.462 --> 41:14.162
Bye.

41:15.533 --> 41:16.332
Go in.
